WEBVTT

00:00:04.590 --> 00:00:07.350
How long will Sekai be practicing?

00:00:08.260 --> 00:00:10.390
It's almost time for dinner.

00:00:14.390 --> 00:00:16.350
Oh, Sekai!

00:00:20.110 --> 00:00:21.190
That girl...

00:00:23.150 --> 00:00:26.110
So you were entering
the tournament as a player.

00:00:27.280 --> 00:00:28.200
Were you surprised?

00:00:28.530 --> 00:00:30.370
Sure I was, but...

00:00:30.370 --> 00:00:31.120
More than that,

00:00:31.540 --> 00:00:34.960
why did you teach me
how to fix my Gunpla?

00:00:36.630 --> 00:00:39.630
Because your Gunpla was beautiful, Sekai.

00:00:41.210 --> 00:00:45.300
When a beautiful thing breaks,
who wouldn't want to fix it?

00:00:45.430 --> 00:00:48.050
That may be true, but...

00:00:48.390 --> 00:00:51.060
In the National Tournament,

00:00:51.060 --> 00:00:53.560
my team might fight
your Gunpla Academy.

00:00:54.100 --> 00:00:56.770
Why help out the enemy?

00:00:57.650 --> 00:01:00.190
I wanted you to be stronger.

00:01:00.610 --> 00:01:01.440
Why?

00:01:03.490 --> 00:01:07.070
I like strong people.

00:01:08.200 --> 00:01:10.910
Isn't that reason enough?

00:01:11.580 --> 00:01:16.790
Sh-Sh-She...

00:01:16.790 --> 00:01:18.500
She confessed her love?!

00:01:36.640 --> 00:01:42.020
<i>Our wings couldn't wait for the wind, so we set out</i>

00:01:42.020 --> 00:01:47.530
<i>We were bathed in the light of the frozen sun</i>

00:01:47.530 --> 00:01:50.280
<i>Oh Oh Oh Oh Oh there are no limits</i>

00:01:50.280 --> 00:01:53.030
<i>Oh Oh Oh Oh Oh just let it go</i>

00:01:53.030 --> 00:01:58.580
<i>Oh Oh Oh Oh Oh loneliness won't break us</i>

00:02:00.380 --> 00:02:03.130
<i>At the end of the dream we'll never give up,</i>

00:02:03.130 --> 00:02:05.760
<i>Will there be a future that can never end?</i>

00:02:05.760 --> 00:02:11.340
<i>Believe in what only you can do</i>

00:02:11.340 --> 00:02:14.060
<i>If I could seize one thing,</i>

00:02:14.060 --> 00:02:16.770
<i>I'd choose it without hesitation</i>

00:02:16.770 --> 00:02:22.060
<i>Follow your instincts, just hold on to our bond</i>

00:02:22.270 --> 00:02:28.610
<i>Up to the endless sky, now! Fly away</i>

00:02:46.550 --> 00:02:49.970
<i>GUNDAM BUILD FIGHTERS TRY</i>

00:02:52.510 --> 00:02:55.010
You want to be stronger, right?

00:02:55.100 --> 00:02:58.520
In that case, I'll build
a beautiful Gunpla for you.

00:02:58.600 --> 00:03:02.020
No need for that.
I have the Try Burning.

00:03:02.480 --> 00:03:04.520
If you fight with my Gunpla,

00:03:04.520 --> 00:03:07.190
you can get much stronger!

00:03:08.190 --> 00:03:13.070
Even becoming world champion in the open
tournament would be within your reach.

00:03:13.070 --> 00:03:14.950
Come on. Let's do it.

00:03:14.950 --> 00:03:16.530
Don't decide for me.

00:03:18.160 --> 00:03:20.460
Honestly, I can't stand this anymore!

00:03:23.960 --> 00:03:25.960
<i>S-S-S-Se...</i>

00:03:28.050 --> 00:03:29.420
Sekai.

00:03:29.510 --> 00:03:32.340
That girl next to you. Wh-Who is she?

00:03:33.300 --> 00:03:35.300
Who is she to you?!

00:03:37.890 --> 00:03:39.930
What do you mean, to me...?

00:03:41.600 --> 00:03:44.310
<i>That girl is from the Gunpla Academy.</i>

00:03:45.520 --> 00:03:46.650
Sekai.

00:03:48.360 --> 00:03:51.360
<i>What's with that cute gesture?!</i>

00:03:51.990 --> 00:03:54.200
<i>This feels like trouble.</i>

00:03:54.200 --> 00:03:58.410
<i>Something inside is calling me
to level one battle stations!</i>

00:03:58.490 --> 00:04:00.540
<i>I can't let her near Sekai.</i>

00:04:01.330 --> 00:04:04.170
<i>How could you let this girl
intrude like this?</i>

00:04:04.250 --> 00:04:06.210
<i>What are you doing, Miss Fumina?!</i>

00:04:09.960 --> 00:04:11.300
What's wrong with Gyanko?

00:04:11.380 --> 00:04:12.470
Gyanko?

00:04:13.170 --> 00:04:14.680
What a funny name.

00:04:15.390 --> 00:04:17.600
Wh-What's so funny?!

00:04:17.680 --> 00:04:19.560
Are you insulting the Gyan?

00:04:19.560 --> 00:04:21.020
Calm down, Gyanko.

00:04:21.020 --> 00:04:23.560
Sekai, are you taking her side?!

00:04:23.560 --> 00:04:25.270
That's not what I meant.

00:04:27.110 --> 00:04:28.570
Please stop it.

00:04:29.400 --> 00:04:31.480
You're making a public scene.

00:04:35.740 --> 00:04:36.870
Who?

00:04:36.870 --> 00:04:37.910
You are...

00:04:38.370 --> 00:04:41.580
They're from Niigata's Toritsu Academy.

00:04:44.370 --> 00:04:47.330
I guess team Try Fighters
must be totally relaxed.

00:04:47.420 --> 00:04:50.340
Yeah, the National Tournament
is already in progress,

00:04:50.340 --> 00:04:52.760
but he's flirting with girls.

00:04:52.760 --> 00:04:55.970
In this situation, we'll
easily win the second round.

00:04:56.090 --> 00:04:59.100
So, you're our opponent
in the second round!

00:04:59.550 --> 00:05:03.680
We advise you to start
packing your bags today.

00:05:04.640 --> 00:05:06.060
Sekai Kamiki.

00:05:06.060 --> 00:05:07.310
What did you say?

00:05:11.110 --> 00:05:14.360
You're going to eat those words!

00:05:14.490 --> 00:05:16.070
Sekai is strong.

00:05:16.610 --> 00:05:18.200
He won't lose to you.

00:05:18.280 --> 00:05:20.530
That's right!
The winner will be...

00:05:21.160 --> 00:05:22.450
Us.

00:05:23.910 --> 00:05:26.120
Team Try Fighters!

00:05:26.540 --> 00:05:28.920
Hey, that's my line!

00:05:32.090 --> 00:05:36.470
I completely missed
my cue to appear.

00:05:37.300 --> 00:05:41.140
Episode 17
Haunted Castle Trap

00:05:42.390 --> 00:05:44.560
She'll build a Gunpla for Sekai?

00:05:45.680 --> 00:05:48.100
That girl from the Gunpla Academy
really said that?

00:05:48.520 --> 00:05:49.650
She did, right?

00:05:50.480 --> 00:05:53.440
I don't get what girls are thinking.

00:05:54.320 --> 00:05:57.320
She helped me fix my Gunpla
although I'm her enemy,

00:05:57.320 --> 00:05:59.700
and said that she'd build me a Gunpla.

00:05:59.860 --> 00:06:03.160
Sekai, you don't understand her feelings?

00:06:03.160 --> 00:06:05.040
Do you, Hoshino?

00:06:05.120 --> 00:06:06.960
Well... yes.

00:06:06.960 --> 00:06:08.620
Then please tell me.

00:06:08.750 --> 00:06:09.920
I don't want to!

00:06:10.000 --> 00:06:11.210
Why not?

00:06:11.210 --> 00:06:13.420
Because I don't want to. That's all.

00:06:14.170 --> 00:06:15.420
Sekai.

00:06:15.510 --> 00:06:18.800
Simply put, Hoshino is
jealous of that girl from-

00:06:18.800 --> 00:06:21.180
Don't analyze it so calmly!

00:06:21.180 --> 00:06:22.350
I'm sorry.

00:06:22.350 --> 00:06:24.350
That's enough chatting.

00:06:25.060 --> 00:06:26.850
Let's start the meeting.

00:06:28.020 --> 00:06:30.850
In the second round
you'll fight the Niigata team.

00:06:30.850 --> 00:06:34.650
(Rising Power)
Toritsu Academy will be a strong foe,
as their name suggests.

00:07:14.520 --> 00:07:15.900
Pause

00:07:17.360 --> 00:07:19.990
That's Toritsu Academy's
first-round battle.

00:07:20.860 --> 00:07:22.910
What do you think?

00:07:23.200 --> 00:07:24.450
Sir!

00:07:24.450 --> 00:07:25.660
Sekai?

00:07:25.660 --> 00:07:27.410
I think they're pretty tough!

00:07:28.240 --> 00:07:31.460
Come on, be more specific.

00:07:32.420 --> 00:07:33.960
Their teamwork is excellent.

00:07:35.130 --> 00:07:38.210
Like the Seiren Technical College
we fought in the regional qualifiers.

00:07:38.300 --> 00:07:39.590
Or even better.

00:07:45.600 --> 00:07:47.430
That SD's construction...

00:07:47.600 --> 00:07:48.260
Pause

00:07:48.260 --> 00:07:50.930
Pause
I assume the machine has some kind of trick.

00:07:52.190 --> 00:07:53.770
I think so, too.

00:07:54.190 --> 00:07:57.110
But what we should be
even more careful about...

00:07:57.110 --> 00:07:58.730
...is their tactics.

00:07:59.860 --> 00:08:03.490
They'll study our machines'
characteristics thoroughly,

00:08:03.490 --> 00:08:06.120
and then devise countermeasures.

00:08:06.120 --> 00:08:10.950
Unless you can overcome their tactics,
you have no chance of winning.

00:08:11.290 --> 00:08:12.290
Yes, sir!
Yes, sir!

00:08:16.540 --> 00:08:20.880
Yuuma Kousaka's
Lightning Gundam Full Burnern.

00:08:26.300 --> 00:08:29.850
Fumina Hoshino's Star Winning Gundam.

00:08:37.480 --> 00:08:41.320
Both are improved versions of
the ones they used in the qualifiers.

00:08:42.530 --> 00:08:45.570
The Lightning's output has been
increased by 33.4 percent.

00:08:46.320 --> 00:08:49.240
The Winning is newly
equipped with funnels.

00:08:49.530 --> 00:08:51.950
But other than that,
we can think of it as...

00:08:51.950 --> 00:08:54.160
...the same support type
she used in the qualifiers.

00:08:55.160 --> 00:08:58.880
How will we deal with Sekai
Kamiki's Try Burning Gundam?

00:08:58.880 --> 00:09:00.250
Watch this video.

00:09:04.010 --> 00:09:07.800
It's footage from the battle with
Wilfrid Kijima at the Nielsen Labs.

00:09:10.390 --> 00:09:11.850
This technique...

00:09:11.930 --> 00:09:14.230
Even for a world-level Gunpla,

00:09:14.310 --> 00:09:16.600
I'm surprised it could
achieve such performance.

00:09:22.530 --> 00:09:24.490
This phenomenon is Assimilation.

00:09:24.900 --> 00:09:26.030
Assimilation?

00:09:26.450 --> 00:09:27.360
Yes.

00:09:27.950 --> 00:09:29.990
Through powerful auto-suggestion,

00:09:29.990 --> 00:09:33.330
the fighter unifies his senses
with the Gunpla itself.

00:09:34.040 --> 00:09:36.160
Thanks to that placebo effect,

00:09:36.160 --> 00:09:38.790
the machine's performance
is increased more than three times.

00:09:41.000 --> 00:09:43.130
It's a Trans-Am system
created by the fighter.

00:09:44.010 --> 00:09:46.050
As long as his
willpower holds out,

00:09:46.550 --> 00:09:49.090
there's no limit to
the operating time.

00:09:49.260 --> 00:09:50.890
But it has a weak point.

00:09:52.220 --> 00:09:55.390
This is after the final match
of the West Tokyo qualifiers.

00:09:57.100 --> 00:09:58.190
Why is he hurt?

00:09:58.560 --> 00:10:02.860
This is the nocebo effect,
a reaction to the placebo effect.

00:10:02.940 --> 00:10:07.110
The damage to the Gunpla is
reflected in the fighter's body.

00:10:08.110 --> 00:10:10.490
The stronger the Gunpla becomes,

00:10:10.570 --> 00:10:13.280
the greater the damage
the fighter sustains.

00:10:15.240 --> 00:10:18.290
If you simply bent the
Gunpla's joints backwards,

00:10:18.290 --> 00:10:20.920
the fighter would suffer severe pain.

00:10:21.380 --> 00:10:22.750
Then it's easy.

00:10:23.170 --> 00:10:26.840
This "Assimilation" is a sword that's
too fragile to be called double-edged.

00:10:27.220 --> 00:10:30.050
But to make sure,
we should use <i>that.</i>

00:10:30.130 --> 00:10:30.550
What?

00:10:30.550 --> 00:10:31.510
Seriously?
What?

00:10:33.100 --> 00:10:35.850
We can't lose in the second round.

00:10:37.600 --> 00:10:40.560
Fully prepared, we'll win the battle.

00:10:42.520 --> 00:10:45.780
<i>We now begin match four
of the second round.</i>

00:10:46.230 --> 00:10:49.360
<i>Representing West Tokyo,
Seiho Academy Middle School,</i>

00:10:49.360 --> 00:10:51.450
<i>team Try Fighters versus...</i>

00:10:51.910 --> 00:10:56.990
<i>...representing Niigata,
Toritsu Academy, team SD-R.</i>

00:10:58.160 --> 00:11:00.160
Toritsu is strong, isn't it?

00:11:00.250 --> 00:11:02.920
Even so, Sekai's team will win!

00:11:04.460 --> 00:11:05.290
<i>Yuuma...</i>

00:11:06.250 --> 00:11:09.220
<i>Don't you dare lose before our fight.</i>

00:11:12.140 --> 00:11:13.470
The time has come.

00:11:13.680 --> 00:11:14.640
Right.

00:11:18.270 --> 00:11:21.190
The opponent is strong, with top-notch tactics.

00:11:21.390 --> 00:11:23.900
You two, brace yourselves!

00:11:24.190 --> 00:11:24.900
Roger!

00:11:24.900 --> 00:11:25.480
Yeah!

00:11:25.480 --> 00:11:26.860
Okay.

00:11:26.860 --> 00:11:28.530
Team Try Fighters.

00:11:28.610 --> 00:11:30.030
Go...
Go...

00:11:30.860 --> 00:11:31.820
"fight!
"fight!

00:11:39.160 --> 00:11:40.120
Let's do this.

00:11:40.200 --> 00:11:41.000
Right.
Right.

00:11:42.710 --> 00:11:44.790
What's your prediction,
Meijin Kawaguchi?

00:11:45.080 --> 00:11:47.920
It may depend on the battlefield.

00:11:49.210 --> 00:11:52.130
Depending on the conditions,
the battle could be one-sided.

00:11:53.180 --> 00:11:56.350
<i>Gunpla Battle, combat mode, startup.</i>

00:11:56.890 --> 00:11:59.390
<i>Model damage level, set to A.</i>

00:12:00.220 --> 00:12:02.020
Please set your GP Base.

00:12:03.900 --> 00:12:06.610
<i>Beginning Plavsky particle dispersal.</i>

00:12:08.940 --> 00:12:11.070
<i>Field 3, Forest.</i>

00:12:11.530 --> 00:12:13.150
It's dark.

00:12:13.240 --> 00:12:15.110
Don't forget to switch
to night-vision sensors.

00:12:15.410 --> 00:12:15.910
Yeah.

00:12:15.910 --> 00:12:16.870
Rogen

00:12:16.950 --> 00:12:18.580
Please set your Gunpla.

00:12:26.250 --> 00:12:27.590
<i>Battle start.</i>

00:12:31.170 --> 00:12:33.550
Fumina Hoshino, Star Winning Gundam.

00:12:34.260 --> 00:12:37.430
Yuuma Kousaka,
Lightning Gundam Full Burnern.

00:12:38.260 --> 00:12:41.060
Sekai Kamiki, Try Burning Gundam.

00:12:42.100 --> 00:12:43.430
Team Try Fighters,

00:12:43.940 --> 00:12:44.690
here we go!

00:12:44.940 --> 00:12:45.770
Here I come.

00:12:46.520 --> 00:12:47.310
Let's g Q!

00:12:59.950 --> 00:13:01.040
Wh-What?

00:13:07.120 --> 00:13:08.040
That's...

00:13:08.330 --> 00:13:09.790
The place where we'll fight?

00:13:10.590 --> 00:13:13.420
This field is virtually
custom-made for us.

00:13:13.840 --> 00:13:15.760
We should thank the system.

00:13:17.470 --> 00:13:18.680
Evidently,

00:13:19.390 --> 00:13:20.850
we've already won.

00:13:31.900 --> 00:13:33.320
It's pretty big.

00:13:33.990 --> 00:13:36.240
Hoshino, do you think
our opponent is inside?

00:13:36.320 --> 00:13:37.150
Yes.

00:13:37.410 --> 00:13:41.410
Inside the castle, the Lightning's
sniping and mobility are restricted.

00:13:41.910 --> 00:13:44.250
<i>Guys, prepare for close combat.</i>

00:13:45.080 --> 00:13:46.540
Are we really going in?

00:13:47.040 --> 00:13:48.420
<i>Sure we are.</i>

00:13:48.500 --> 00:13:52.500
<i>If we don't hurry, we'll give
them time to set a trap.</i>

00:13:52.800 --> 00:13:53.500
<i>Hurry UP-</i>

00:13:53.630 --> 00:13:54.630
<i>Roger.</i>

00:14:06.480 --> 00:14:08.480
<i>It's spooky around here.</i>

00:14:08.600 --> 00:14:09.690
<i>I</i> agree.

00:14:09.850 --> 00:14:11.900
If this were real,
it would be a little scary.

00:14:12.820 --> 00:14:13.610
<i>Hoshino.</i>

00:14:13.820 --> 00:14:14.530
What is it?

00:14:15.400 --> 00:14:16.360
<i>Actually...</i>

00:14:18.110 --> 00:14:19.820
<i>I hate ghosts.</i>

00:14:19.820 --> 00:14:20.820
What?!

00:14:23.030 --> 00:14:24.660
<i>Now you tell me.</i>

00:14:25.200 --> 00:14:26.540
<i>I'm sorry.</i>

00:15:05.370 --> 00:15:06.410
<i>Ghosts!</i>

00:15:06.410 --> 00:15:07.040
<i>What are you doing, Yuuma?!
Ghosts!</i>

00:15:07.040 --> 00:15:08.200
<i>What are you doing, Yuuma?!</i>

00:15:09.790 --> 00:15:10.370
A ghost!

00:15:10.370 --> 00:15:13.540
<i>Calm down, Yuu!
The wall just fell down.</i>

00:15:15.540 --> 00:15:17.710
Darn. Just a false alarm.

00:15:18.010 --> 00:15:20.930
<i>Don't act cool!
You need to get off me!</i>

00:15:20.930 --> 00:15:22.260
<i>I know that.</i>

00:15:22.430 --> 00:15:24.760
<i>If you don't get off,
I can't move!</i>

00:15:24.890 --> 00:15:26.760
<i>I know, but...</i>

00:15:29.310 --> 00:15:30.230
An enemy!

00:15:37.440 --> 00:15:40.440
<i>Why don't you fly already?!</i>

00:15:40.610 --> 00:15:43.280
<i>My body isn't listening to me!</i>

00:15:43.490 --> 00:15:45.780
<i>Sekai, Yuu! I'll help you-</i>

00:15:58.300 --> 00:15:59.170
The hole!

00:15:59.460 --> 00:16:00.130
Oh no!

00:16:00.420 --> 00:16:01.470
They've been separated.

00:16:07.100 --> 00:16:09.520
There must be
a route underground.

00:16:12.810 --> 00:16:13.980
From there!

00:16:22.190 --> 00:16:23.900
Where's the underground route?

00:16:26.200 --> 00:16:26.820
A trap?!

00:16:34.210 --> 00:16:35.920
The path is blocked.

00:16:36.330 --> 00:16:38.040
A trap like this
in such a short time?

00:16:41.840 --> 00:16:43.090
A time bomb?!

00:16:51.100 --> 00:16:53.520
<i>Darn. It's completely blocked.</i>

00:16:54.440 --> 00:16:55.850
<i>Sekai, is there any way out?</i>

00:16:56.400 --> 00:16:58.520
<i>I found one, but it's no use.</i>

00:16:58.520 --> 00:17:00.860
<i>Our Gunpla wouldn't pass through.</i>

00:17:01.940 --> 00:17:03.860
And I can't contact Hoshino.

00:17:04.900 --> 00:17:07.030
<i>They've even cut off
our communications.</i>

00:17:11.160 --> 00:17:12.120
<i>We're surrounded?</i>

00:17:13.330 --> 00:17:14.460
<i>Stay on guard, Sekai!</i>

00:17:22.340 --> 00:17:25.470
<i>What?! My Gunpla
is suddenly so heavy.</i>

00:17:37.270 --> 00:17:38.480
It absorbed the beam?!

00:17:38.730 --> 00:17:40.060
That system is...!

00:17:40.400 --> 00:17:44.400
The technique Sei first used
in the 7th World Tournament.

00:17:44.900 --> 00:17:46.200
The Absorb System!

00:17:47.280 --> 00:17:48.820
<i>This is an advanced version.</i>

00:17:49.820 --> 00:17:52.200
<i>It keeps absorbing particles
at the target point.</i>

00:17:52.950 --> 00:17:56.660
<i>Not just beams, but even
particles floating in space.</i>

00:17:57.540 --> 00:17:59.080
If beams don't work...

00:18:03.380 --> 00:18:04.300
I won't let you.

00:18:04.300 --> 00:18:05.170
Darn it.

00:18:05.260 --> 00:18:06.420
I'll do it, then!

00:18:20.100 --> 00:18:22.980
My power is being absorbed.

00:18:25.070 --> 00:18:26.990
At this rate, he can't rage on.

00:18:27.780 --> 00:18:28.400
<i>Sekai!</i>

00:18:30.320 --> 00:18:31.990
<i>Let's end this.</i>

00:18:36.450 --> 00:18:37.870
Yuuma, the Lightning will-

00:18:38.080 --> 00:18:38.960
Never mind!

00:18:39.290 --> 00:18:42.710
<i>We gotta hold out until
Hoshino gets here!</i>

00:18:45.340 --> 00:18:46.760
I don't have any more time.

00:18:47.130 --> 00:18:48.800
This might cause a cave-in, but...

00:18:52.970 --> 00:18:55.180
Gun bits, maximum output!

00:18:56.520 --> 00:18:58.310
Go!

00:19:06.480 --> 00:19:07.440
What happened?!

00:19:10.320 --> 00:19:12.410
Our bomb reached
its time limit.

00:19:13.120 --> 00:19:14.910
<i>The Star Winning is gone.</i>

00:19:15.120 --> 00:19:16.040
What?!

00:19:18.540 --> 00:19:19.500
Yuuma!

00:19:20.500 --> 00:19:24.040
All that remains is
Sekai Kamiki's Try Burning.

00:19:27.300 --> 00:19:29.840
Who said I was gone?!

00:19:31.010 --> 00:19:33.260
<i>Hyper beam cannon!</i>

00:19:33.930 --> 00:19:34.350
<i>What? !</i>

00:19:40.270 --> 00:19:41.560
<i>Sekai! Yuu!</i>

00:19:41.850 --> 00:19:42.480
Hoshino!
Hoshino!

00:19:43.560 --> 00:19:44.190
<i>How...?!</i>

00:19:45.440 --> 00:19:47.820
<i>Don't underestimate
my Star Winning!</i>

00:19:48.280 --> 00:19:50.490
<i>Go, Star Funnels!</i>

00:19:56.080 --> 00:19:57.410
I can move!

00:19:57.830 --> 00:19:59.160
<i>Toshiya, the Absorb is-</i>

00:19:59.410 --> 00:20:00.000
I know.

00:20:00.830 --> 00:20:01.910
Here comes the Assimilation.

00:20:05.250 --> 00:20:07.250
<i>Our battle starts here!</i>

00:20:08.460 --> 00:20:11.050
<i>Nobu, Kazu, let's use our trump card.</i>

00:20:11.130 --> 00:20:11.760
<i>Roger that.
Roger that.</i>

00:20:13.300 --> 00:20:15.930
<i>I'll pay you back for everything.</i>

00:20:16.260 --> 00:20:17.220
Let's g Q!

00:20:17.300 --> 00:20:19.270
Jigen Haoh School!

00:20:27.400 --> 00:20:28.400
<i>What's that?!</i>

00:20:29.110 --> 00:20:30.150
<i>It's bright.</i>

00:20:30.940 --> 00:20:32.360
The Gunpla are glowing!

00:20:32.440 --> 00:20:33.490
Why?

00:20:35.110 --> 00:20:37.410
That particle emission level is...!

00:20:37.780 --> 00:20:41.330
They're using the particles
that they've been absorbing!

00:20:42.580 --> 00:20:44.790
Nobu, how's the particle supply?

00:20:44.790 --> 00:20:46.830
<i>93 percent. We're ready.</i>

00:20:47.130 --> 00:20:47.920
Kazu.

00:20:47.960 --> 00:20:50.050
<i>Each part's in good shape. No problems.</i>

00:20:50.920 --> 00:20:51.960
Commence docking.

00:20:52.170 --> 00:20:52.970
Roger that!
Roger that!

00:20:53.800 --> 00:20:55.380
<i>SD-R formation!
SD-R formation!</i>

00:20:58.970 --> 00:21:00.470
Toritsu's Gunpla are...

00:21:00.600 --> 00:21:01.520
...separating?!

00:21:14.450 --> 00:21:15.570
They combined!

00:21:15.990 --> 00:21:16.610
What's that?!

00:21:16.820 --> 00:21:17.610
That's...

00:21:17.990 --> 00:21:19.070
That figure is...!

00:21:21.200 --> 00:21:24.330
Th-This is Toritsu Academy's...

00:21:27.170 --> 00:21:28.790
Their Gunpla's true form.

00:21:30.960 --> 00:21:33.090
Th-This is...

00:21:34.840 --> 00:21:37.180
To fight the Gunpla Academy,

00:21:37.300 --> 00:21:40.470
we developed the ultimate machine.
we developed the ultimate machine.

00:21:40.930 --> 00:21:42.180
Its name is...

00:21:48.190 --> 00:21:50.270
<i>Snibal-Drago-Gira!
Snibal-Drago-Gira!</i>

00:21:59.870 --> 00:22:02.950
<i>There's a tomorrow I want to touch</i>

00:22:02.950 --> 00:22:06.330
<i>I want to prove it for myself</i>

00:22:06.330 --> 00:22:11.130
<i>Love, hate, which is it?</i>

00:22:11.880 --> 00:22:14.960
<i>Perhaps the challenge is in the journey</i>

00:22:14.960 --> 00:22:18.050
<i>Wandering the unknown path...</i>

00:22:18.050 --> 00:22:24.810
<i>...toward abundant happiness</i>

00:22:26.560 --> 00:22:29.560
<i>I was afraid to run</i>

00:22:29.560 --> 00:22:32.940
<i>But now that I've started, I can't stop</i>

00:22:32.940 --> 00:22:35.730
<i>I must've been waiting for the go sign</i>

00:22:35.730 --> 00:22:39.570
<i>With this passion in my impatient heart,</i>

00:22:39.570 --> 00:22:44.240
<i>I want to search for something</i>

00:22:44.240 --> 00:22:49.000
<i>Let's meet over and over again (with you)</i>

00:22:49.000 --> 00:22:51.290
<i>On this journey, can you show me...</i>

00:22:51.290 --> 00:22:56.340
...a <i>different truth? (let me see)</i>

00:22:56.340 --> 00:23:03.260
<i>The power to find new things (with me)</i>

00:23:03.260 --> 00:23:06.770
<i>Never forget it</i>

00:23:06.770 --> 00:23:09.140
<i>Bring the real you to meet the real me</i>

00:23:09.140 --> 00:23:09.690
<i>(Today)
Bring the real you to meet the real me</i>

00:23:09.690 --> 00:23:11.310
<i>(Today)
As we travel, you smile at me</i>

00:23:11.310 --> 00:23:12.190
<i>(I'll be there...)
As we travel, you smile at me</i>

00:23:12.190 --> 00:23:15.190
<i>(I'll be there...)
I love it, I love it, this journey without a compass</i>

00:23:15.190 --> 00:23:17.570
<i>(Alive!)
I love it, I love it, this journey without a compass</i>

00:23:17.570 --> 00:23:18.530
<i>(Alive!)</i>

00:23:18.570 --> 00:23:24.450
Team Try Fighters!

00:23:26.950 --> 00:23:29.500
This is Toritsu Academy's Gunpla.

00:23:30.410 --> 00:23:33.000
The beast they created
to get back at us.

00:23:33.080 --> 00:23:34.250
Get back at you?

00:23:34.330 --> 00:23:36.460
Did something happen?

00:23:36.460 --> 00:23:39.550
Toritsu's team leader
is Toshiya Shiki.

00:23:41.010 --> 00:23:43.970
He failed to enter
the Gunpla Academy.

00:23:45.140 --> 00:23:48.100
His grudge grew and grew until...

00:23:51.310 --> 00:23:53.480
...it turned into a monster.

00:24:00.650 --> 00:24:02.820
The SD Gundams combined to become a dragon?

00:24:02.820 --> 00:24:05.070
Using the particles they absorbed from us?!

00:24:05.070 --> 00:24:05.660
Next episode, "Snibal-Drago-Gira".

00:24:05.660 --> 00:24:07.160
Snibal-Drago-Gira

00:24:07.160 --> 00:24:10.040
Snlbal-Drago-Gira
Even so, there's a Winning Road!
